==Behind the scenes==
The position of chancellor of the New Republic first appeared the current [[canon]] in the [[2015]] novel [[Aftermath (novel)|''Aftermath'']], written by [[Chuck Wendig]].<ref name="Aftermath" /> In the Expanded Universe of books, comics, and games, which has since become the non-canon [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity,<ref name="Legends Announcement">{{SW|url=news/the-legendary-star-wars-expanded-universe-turns-a-new-page|text=The Legendary Star Wars Expanded Universe Turns a New Page}}</ref> the leader of the [[New Republic/Legends|New Republic]] was known as the [[Chief of State (New Republic)/Legends|Chief of State]]. Like in canon, Legends stories also depicted [[Mon Mothma/Legends|Mon Mothma]] as the first leader of the New Republic.<ref name="Heir to the Empire">''[[Heir to the Empire]]''</ref>

